fig.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n163:        artifact_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n164:        artifact_root_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n166:        artifact_archive_root: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}/_archive\"\n172:        - artifact_dir: \"Resolved review packet directory for this target\"\n177:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n180:        reducer_artifact_arg: \"--artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\"\n202:  step_fanout_spawn:\n203:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n207:      isolated sub-packet under {artifact_dir}/lineages/{label}/.\n208:      This step runs before phase_init, so pass the raw review_focus. fanout-run.cjs\n217:      deep/review command surface with config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir so the LEAF\n220:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n221:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n222:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n224:      step_fanout_spawn_cli:\n235:            --base-artifact-dir {artifact_dir} \\\n245:  phase_init:\n389:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n420:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n547:      step_create_state_log:\n1105:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1108:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1111:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1520:            - \"Fail closed before dispatch unless the rendered containment sections exist, --dir is an isolated linked worktree, the primary worktree is clean, and current-worktree changes are confined to artifact_dir both by name and after every path component is resolved through symlinks; append the recovery-baseline commit to state_log\"\n1525:            - \"cli-opencode self-invocation guard: this single-executor branch must only run from a non-OpenCode dispatch surface (Claude Code/raw shell). Explicit parallel-detached cli-opencode fan-out is handled by step_fanout_spawn_cli/fanout-run.cjs, not this branch. the `cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode` mode's SKILL.md (`.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/SKILL.md`) §SELF-INVOCATION PROHIBITED contract is the authoritative gate\"\n1601:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1658:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the review pass yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n1717:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1818:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1920:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1971:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type review --artifact-dir {artifact_dir} --iteration {current_iteration}\"\n2222:  phase_synthesis:\n2232:            --artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\n2338:        note: \"A fan-out root has no root state log before closeout, so the root reducer would fail on the missing file. Each lineage emits its own map, so the report names the ones that exist at {artifact_dir}/lineages/*/resource-map.md.\"\n2452:      step_update_config_status:\n2457:      step_stage_artifact_dir:\n2458:        skip_when: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n2459:        action: \"Stage all skill-owned artifacts under artifact_dir for the operator's next git commit\"\n2460:        command: \"git add {state_paths.artifact_dir}\"\n2461:        note: \"Staging the whole artifact_dir keeps the iteration trail (iterations/, deltas/, state.jsonl, strategy, findings-registry, and the report) together; the operator keeps commit authority and can `git restore --staged {path}` before committing. Failure is non-fatal -- log warning and continue.\"\n2462:        on_fail: \"Log warning. Do not block synthesis. The artifact_dir may be outside a git repo (e.g., temp test fixture) which is a valid case.\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"40:  config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir: \"[optional internal path] - Fan-out lineage artifact override for command-owned single-lineage execution.\"\n46:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n100:  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode review --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <record file>\"\n130:  packet_dir: \"{artifact_dir}\"\n133:  config: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-review-config.json\"\n134:  state_log: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-review-state.jsonl\"\n135:  findings_registry: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-review-findings-registry.json\"\n136:  strategy: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-review-strategy.md\"\n137:  dashboard: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-review-dashboard.md\"\n138:  pause_sentinel: \"{artifact_dir}/.deep-review-pause\"\n139:  lock_file: \"{artifact_dir}/.deep-review.lock\"\n140:  prompt_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/prompts\"\n141:  iteration_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations\"\n142:  iteration_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md\"\n146:  delta_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/deltas\"\n147:  delta_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/deltas/iter-{NNN}.jsonl\"\n148:  review_output: \"{artifact_dir}/review-report.md\"\n149:  resource_map_output: \"{artifact_dir}/resource-map.md\"\n160:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n163:        artifact_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n164:        artifact_root_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n166:        artifact_archive_root: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}/_archive\"\n172:        - artifact_dir: \"Resolved review packet directory for this target\"\n177:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n180:        reducer_artifact_arg: \"--artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\"\n202:  step_fanout_spawn:\n203:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n207:      isolated sub-packet under {artifact_dir}/lineages/{label}/.\n208:      This step runs before phase_init, so pass the raw review_focus. fanout-run.cjs\n217:      deep/review command surface with config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir so the LEAF\n220:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n221:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n222:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n224:      step_fanout_spawn_cli:\n235:            --base-artifact-dir {artifact_dir} \\\n245:  phase_init:\n389:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n420:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n547:      step_create_state_log:\n1105:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1108:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1111:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1520:            - \"Fail closed before dispatch unless the rendered containment sections exist, --dir is an isolated linked worktree, the primary worktree is clean, and current-worktree changes are confined to artifact_dir both by name and after every path component is resolved through symlinks; append the recovery-baseline commit to state_log\"\n1525:            - \"cli-opencode self-invocation guard: this single-executor branch must only run from a non-OpenCode dispatch surface (Claude Code/raw shell). Explicit parallel-detached cli-opencode fan-out is handled by step_fanout_spawn_cli/fanout-run.cjs, not this branch. the `cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode` mode's SKILL.md (`.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/SKILL.md`) §SELF-INVOCATION PROHIBITED contract is the authoritative gate\"\n1601:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1658:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the review pass yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n1717:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1818:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1920:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1971:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type review --artifact-dir {artifact_dir} --iteration {current_iteration}\"\n2222:  phase_synthesis:\n2232:            --artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\n2338:        note: \"A fan-out root has no root state log before closeout, so the root reducer would fail on the missing file. Each lineage emits its own map, so the report names the ones that exist at {artifact_dir}/lineages/*/resource-map.md.\"\n2452:      step_update_config_status:\n2457:      step_stage_artifact_dir:\n2458:        skip_when: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n2459:        action: \"Stage all skill-owned artifacts under artifact_dir for the operator's next git commit\"\n2460:        command: \"git add {state_paths.artifact_dir}\"\n2461:        note: \"Staging the whole artifact_dir keeps the iteration trail (iterations/, deltas/, state.jsonl, strategy, findings-registry, and the report) together; the operator keeps commit authority and can `git restore --staged {path}` before committing. Failure is non-fatal -- log warning and continue.\"\n2462:        on_fail: \"Log warning. Do not block synthesis. The artifact_dir may be outside a git repo (e.g., temp test fixture) which is a valid case.\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"grep -n \\\"phase_init\\\\|phase_main_loop\\\\|phase_synthesis\\\\|step_create_state_log\\\\|step_reduce_state\\\\|step_update_config_status\\\\|step_fanout_spawn\\\\|step_init_strategy\\\\|artifact_dir\\\\|fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml | head -80\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794682902451,"end":1794682905174}}}}
