{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794683282167,"sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d3ffe8hgDLTRt6IhrOl","part":{"partID":"prt_1db759fb0001qdIv5JtSMcapWA","sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d3ffe8hgDLTRt6IhrOl","messageID":"msg_1db757f690011Y0YbMHjglm0Hv","type":"tool","id":"call_108cca5ef7b0474d9c7e7a8c","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"offerError\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs | head -20","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:21:// A failed replay returns null fields plus an offerError, so a backfill over a\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:52:function failedOffer(offerError) {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:53:  return { offeredCommand: null, offeredPolicy: null, offeredAs: null, offerError };\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:97: *   offeredAs: 'head' | 'partner' | null, offerError: string | null }}\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:146:  return { ...parseOffer(firstLine), offerError: null };\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:456:      offer = { offeredCommand: null, offeredPolicy: null, offerError: 'no_checkout' };\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:459:          offer = { offeredCommand: null, offeredPolicy: null, offerError: 'untrusted_checkout' };\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:497:        offerError: offer.offerError ?? null,\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"me