{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794683342545,"sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d3ffe8hgDLTRt6IhrOl","part":{"partID":"prt_1db768a830018ZL5bHgMtG6g2g","sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d3ffe8hgDLTRt6IhrOl","messageID":"msg_1db7673c0001XDdCVqDXhi6aZc","type":"tool","id":"call_b467bedc54c0409ead528630","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"head -c 2500 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/review-report.md; echo; echo \"---delta---\"; head -3 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deltas/iter-003.jsonl | cut -c1-800","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"# Review Report: Command Surfacing Build, Pass Four (accuracy-runner lineage)\n\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder)\n- Pass: the confirming round of review pass four, on the fix range `11af224a34..48f03b5013`.\n- Lineage: `accuracy-runner-confirm-4b`, area `accuracy-runner`, run `fanout-accuracy-runner-confirm-4b-1794680176420-xvj4ed`, executor `cli-opencode` `opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash` at reasoning effort max.\n- Reviewed scope: the nine paths in `review/review-scope-4b.txt` whose area is `accuracy-runner` — the routing-accuracy offer and runner pair, their two changed tests, the Codex session reader and its test, the Codex declaration map, and the doctor presentation row — plus the shared README that describes the pair.\n- Inputs to this synthesis: the three iteration narratives, the three delta files, the lineage registry (2 active P2 findings), the strategy and the dashboard.\n- Cross-area boundary: `lib/command-attach.ts`, the scorer modules, the feature docs and `score-command-transcripts.mjs` belong to `scorer-attach-confirm-4b`. This lineage read them only as context and raises no finding against them.\n- Iteration cap: 3 of 3. The loop stopped at the cap; convergence was not declared.\n- Operator review focus: Confirming round of review pass four of command surfacing. FIRST read and follow specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-4b.txt: it names the scope file, the commit range, which files your lineage reviews and the checks. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl or holdout-prompts.jsonl except through jq 'del(.prompt)', never run git diff, show or log -p over a path that includes command-prompts.jsonl without the pathspec ':(exclude)**/command-prompts.jsonl', and never print a prompt whose split is holdout. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Executive Summary\n\n- **Verdict: PASS.** No P0 and no P1 findings are active.\n- **hasAdvisories: true.** Two P2 documentation drifts remain active.\n- **Active counts:** P0 0, P1 0, P2 2.\n- **The P1 that this round confirms is fixed.** `offeredAs` now travels from `parseOffer` through both run-log writers: the backfill at `command-offer.mjs:496` and the live turn at `run-command-behaviour.mjs:1203` via `offerLineFields`. The scorer's single consumer reads the field at `score-command-transcripts.mjs:1471-1476`.\n- **The Codex co\n---delta---\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"fanout-accuracy-runner-confirm-4b-1794680176420-xvj4ed\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"RECOVERY (least-covered traceability and maintainability)\",\"dimensions\":[\"traceability\",\"maintainability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:63-80,120-126,183-188\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt:255-272\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1170-1209\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/027-review-pass-four-remediation/tasks\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"AR4B-P2-001\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"cluster\":\"doc_code_drift\",\"title\":\"The README still says the backfill adds three fields and lists three in the runner row\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:76\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"AR4B-P2-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"cluster\":\"doc_code_drift\",\"title\":\"The README says every run line carries four attribution fields, but a head-moved line carries none\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:65\",\"iteration\":3}\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Review Report: Command Surfacing Build, Pass Four (accuracy-runner lineage)\n\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder)\n- Pass: the confirming round of review pass four, on the fix range `11af224a34..48f03b5013`.\n- Lineage: `accuracy-runner-confirm-4b`, area `accuracy-runner`, run `fanout-accuracy-runner-confirm-4b-1794680176420-xvj4ed`, executor `cli-opencode` `opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash` at reasoning effort max.\n- Reviewed scope: the nine paths in `review/review-scope-4b.txt` whose area is `accuracy-runner` — the routing-accuracy offer and runner pair, their two changed tests, the Codex session reader and its test, the Codex declaration map, and the doctor presentation row — plus the shared README that describes the pair.\n- Inputs to this synthesis: the three iteration narratives, the three delta files, the lineage registry (2 active P2 findings), the strategy and the dashboard.\n- Cross-area boundary: `lib/command-attach.ts`, the scorer modules, the feature docs and `score-command-tra